# Runtime files that live only on the VPS, beside the compose file.
#
# The repo root .gitignore already covers a bare `.env`, but NOT these — and
# .env.codepush is the file that holds the Supabase JWT, the storage key and
# (during the two-flip cutover) the Azure storage account key. Committing it
# would publish every credential the service has.
.env.codepush
.env.codepush.*

# CODEPUSH_TAG pin for a rollback. Read by `docker compose` for variable
# substitution; deliberately host-local so a pinned rollback survives a
# `git pull` and is never accidentally shipped as the default for everyone.
.env

# Release hold marker — pauses the GHCR poller. Operational state, not config.
.deploy-hold
